      "text": "A wave of molasses, taller than a bus, just hit Boston."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 4.43,
      "words": 2,
      "intensity": 5.5,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "January, nineteen-nineteen."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 5.2,
      "words": 6,
      "intensity": 5.5,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "How does syrup kill twenty-one people?"
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 7.81,
      "words": 15,
      "intensity": 3.5,
      "entities": [
        "million"
      ],
      "text": "Two million gallons burst from one tank and ran at around thirty-five miles an hour."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 13.58,
      "words": 11,
      "intensity": 3.0,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "Molasses is about one and a half times heavier than water."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 18.11,
      "words": 7,
      "intensity": 4.0,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "Then the cold thickened it, like glue."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 20.8,
      "words": 7,
      "intensity": 3.0,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "Many victims died because they were stuck."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 23.79,
      "words": 4,
      "intensity": 4.5,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "This wasn't bad luck."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 25.33,
      "words": 6,
      "intensity": 4.5,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "That tank leaked from day one."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 27.64,
      "words": 3,
      "intensity": 6.5,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "The company's fix?"
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 29.09,
      "words": 8,
      "intensity": 3.0,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "Paint it brown, so the leaks wouldn't show."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 32.47,
      "words": 5,
      "intensity": 5.5,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "So how does syrup kill?"
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 34.39,
      "words": 5,
      "intensity": 4.5,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "Weight, cold, and warnings ignored."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 36.57,
      "words": 17,
      "intensity": 3.0,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "The owners were found liable, and Boston began making engineers file their math and sign their plans."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 43.1,
      "words": 3,
      "intensity": 5.5,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "They still do."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 44.56,
      "words": 8,
      "intensity": 4.0,
      "entities": [],
      "text": "Would you have lived next to that tank?"
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 47.83,
      "words": 5,
      "intensity": 4.5,
